          "filename": "ISS006-E-14702 - View of South Africa.jpg",
          "caption": "View of South Africa taken during ISS Expedition 6. In view are the eastern section of the Overstrand Local Municipality, and the western section of Cape Agulhas Local Municipality, both in the Western Cape, South Africa. Danger Point is the conspicuous, conical headland jutting into the Atlantic Ocean below, while the Indian Ocean is visible beyond Cape Agulhas, at top right.",
